---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Submit a service"
  description="Submit a free-tier service to opentier via a GitHub issue form."
  canonical="https://opentier.dev/submit"
>
  <section class="container-narrow submit-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contribute</p>
      <h1>Submit a service.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Spotted a developer service with a real free tier we don't list? Open an issue with the
        pre-filled form below. A maintainer reviews, labels it, and the YAML record + PR is
        scaffolded automatically.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="cta-wrap">
      <a
        class="cta"
        href="https://github.com/Pratiyush/opentier/issues/new/choose"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Open a submission issue →
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Before you submit</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>
          The free tier must be permanent. Trial credits and 14-day evaluation tiers are not
          eligible.
        </li>
        <li>The service must be alive — commits in the last 18 months or active marketing.</li>
        <li>
          No credit card requirements without disclosure (we don't exclude them, but we flag them).
        </li>
        <li>You don't have a commercial affiliation with the service (or you've disclosed it).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>The form lands as an issue with the <code>submission</code> label.</li>
        <li>A maintainer reviews the free-tier claim against today's pricing page.</li>
        <li>If accepted, they add the <code>ready-to-scaffold</code> label.</li>
        <li>
          A GitHub Action parses the issue and opens a draft PR with the YAML record filled in.
        </li>
        <li>CI runs lint → validate → check-logos → build. Green is required to merge.</li>
        <li>Merge → Cloudflare Pages deploys → your service shows up in the catalog.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </section>

  <style>
    .submit-page {
      padding-top: var(--space-xl);
      padding-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    }
    .lede {
      margin-top: var(--space-md);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      max-width: 56ch;
    }
    .cta-wrap {
      margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    }
    .cta {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
      background: var(--color-ink);
      color: var(--color-paper);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .cta:hover {
      background: var(--color-coral);
    }
    .block {
      padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
      border-top: var(--border-rule);
    }
    .block h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    }
    .checklist,
    .steps {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-sm);
    }
    code {
      background: var(--color-paper-deep);
      padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 0.92em;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
